message: >-
  If you use BAM (Business Automation Machine), please cite it using this
  metadata.
title: BAM - Business Automation Machine
type: software
authors:
  - name: v0idbrn
repository-code: "https://github.com/v0idbrn/Autobussiness"
url: "https://github.com/v0idbrn/Autobussiness"
abstract: >-
  Local-first prospect-to-delivery operating system for a one-person tech
  business: RSS/URL/CSV company discovery, evidence-backed multi-page web
  research with SHA-256 provenance, deterministic opportunity scoring,
  human-gated commercial workflow (briefs, outreach drafts, quotes), and
  subprocess adapters for external document services. No automatic outreach;
  every sensitive action requires recorded human approval.
keywords:
  - business-automation
  - lead-research
  - crm
  - local-first
  - evidence-based
  - human-in-the-loop
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-09-15"
